    "These are honest draft terms for local and TestFlight evaluation. Public hosting and owner legal review are still required before App Store release.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are honest draft terms for local and TestFlight evaluation. Public hosting and owner legal review are still required before App Store release."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estas son unas condiciones preliminares honestas para la evaluación local y en TestFlight. El alojamiento público y la revisión legal del propietario siguen siendo necesarios antes del lanzamiento en el App Store."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Это честный проект условий для локального тестирования и TestFlight. До выпуска в App Store ещё нужны публичная публикация и юридическая проверка владельцем."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These terms apply when you use Volta. Availability, price, parking, and access can change; verify the public source and onsite conditions before routing or charging.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These terms apply when you use Volta. Availability, price, parking, and access can change; verify the public source and onsite conditions before routing or charging."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estas condiciones se aplican al usar Volta. La disponibilidad, el precio, el aparcamiento y el acceso pueden cambiar; verifica la fuente pública y las condiciones del lugar antes de iniciar la ruta o cargar."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
